<title>FINLAND: FINNISH YIELD GAP VS BUNDS 20 BPS BY END-97-UNIBANK.</title>
<headline>FINNISH YIELD GAP VS BUNDS 20 BPS BY END-97-UNIBANK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish Unibank said in its weekly Nordic markets report on Monday it expected the Finnish 2006 bond yield gap over Germany to narrow to around 20 basis points by the end of this year.</p>
<p>&quot;We still see potential in the Finnish market with further spread narrowing to some 20 bp by the year's end,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>At last Friday's close, the yield differential was 24 basis points.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248</p>
